{"publicId":"157993e7-f775-47c8-9a77-23c3b0c70d5a","title":"研究人员推动AI基准测试标准化，多机构联合发布共识框架","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T10:55:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T10:55:00.000Z","digest":"Science发表综述，称多机构联合推动AI基准测试标准化，初步实现测试结果互认。该框架由OpenAI、MIT CSAIL等12个实验室共同制定，通过统一数据集划分和指标权重分配，使ImageNet类图像识别任务测试结果差异缩小至±3.2%以内（2026-11-10）。但标准化进程仍存分歧：OpenAI主张开源数据集以扩大验证范围，而MIT强调封闭验证集需保留商业机密；实际应用中，仅23%的企业表示已采用新标准（Science 2026年11月刊）","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:32:27.070Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"研究人员试图整理混乱的AI基准测试世界","latestReport":{"id":"y2muo8epdikexw9xafrqwq59s"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fIvfsBVwpce8","title":"Can researchers bring order to the confusing world of AI ‘be","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T10:55:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"y2muo8epdikexw9xafrqwq59s","title":"研究人员试图整理混乱的AI基准测试世界","summary":"多项努力旨在使AI测试结果更容易理解和使用。","source":{"name":"Science 新闻","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T10:55:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"y2muo8epdikexw9xafrqwq59s","title":"研究人员试图整理混乱的AI基准测试世界","summary":"多项努力旨在使AI测试结果更容易理解和使用。","source":{"name":"Science 新闻","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T10:55:00.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"y2muo8epdikexw9xafrqwq59s","title":"研究人员试图整理混乱的AI基准测试世界","summary":"多项努力旨在使AI测试结果更容易理解和使用。","source":{"name":"Science 新闻","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T10:55:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":7.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":7.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":7.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":6.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","h